{"id":283387303,"title":"2.中篇+下篇","summary":"1.常用类型5.objectObject除了下面两个不可以存储外，其他的都是可以的。","content":"<h1>1.常用类型</h1>\n<h2>5.object</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788186173536-5d614a8d-e497-4d06-8eb3-df59fcfec53e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788186185810-a602573d-eb2d-4f71-9497-fc306717c2a9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Object除了下面两个不可以存储外，其他的都是可以的。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788186296763-a27b929f-509a-46b6-aeeb-dc71a55d4a56.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788186344422-622cb8a7-2376-4e77-a5b4-127b65edfb76.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788186372305-578552ae-5b89-4c09-802b-eb814262f1d6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788186457877-f9fdbbcd-f988-4353-ae26-9f3ff00ced4f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788266619549-65d8ce8d-1352-43a3-976e-a3de30589d0e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788266681805-a7404325-0a97-4fc6-81e4-a88f8cce12c1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788266868237-cafec350-1c93-4761-9ed4-b4ad744a8bf5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>不写数据类型也可以的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788266904031-33eae3f2-fb1c-4e65-bbb2-547cbf67544a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788267120663-c5d08048-4245-4478-b4ff-ffd326cbb231.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>第1个是字符串的数组，第2个是number的数组<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788267060659-6b1b2d68-bfae-43c0-9a4d-25aeda66f196.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>6.tuple</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788267140761-b118b0d8-3f21-488e-af17-daee80a4ed32.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>7.enum</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788267345079-9647a2b6-1e02-4ac9-824b-35bcc9303c85.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788267584604-69062934-5872-4df0-b204-0223f2d83d4e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788267621461-9327a3d6-9a94-4d88-b51d-cb2b80bdf8be.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788267636874-f39dc973-53e7-419e-af35-a6f2e09c26cd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788268256482-472aea86-01a4-4c7a-80b7-0030111dd9e4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788268377622-8427fa90-b610-4edc-8e1b-acddbe499fbb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788268385217-4ae35cd8-119a-46e7-b408-8b17e3d6822f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788268399301-71e0ba20-1fce-494d-a020-2aa249c85a9f.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788268551407-b1be5c27-f6d2-4668-864d-4b75a638f215.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788268559671-9f2e3922-0289-4b1b-8ac0-5a11e4726fee.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788268570050-9894052a-8853-4ccc-9231-cb664406ca22.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788268578832-1e81b9b3-f2cb-49f3-8017-ee50a283ee40.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788268586582-a576e1d6-e522-4bd7-92d5-2666d867c2c3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>8.type</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788268947912-f5c710bb-b92f-4ef6-91d6-77db448bcf38.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788268978122-f0ab5393-abce-4e9a-82c5-63d169225a64.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788269138616-9f08f82e-91fa-4fb7-9009-764164bbad6b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>9.一个特殊情况</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788269505700-98fb3f99-12a2-424e-bf7a-1641ec712da8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788269471963-4e7156c6-5433-4699-a15a-fe4fe61e4f8e.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788269489798-df73c4a2-7ee4-4361-94b1-f81b63bd7d65.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788269446237-c5250b0a-b8a9-4327-b48b-8b16475df359.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>10.复习类相关的知识</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270149595-56e7ec55-f1a3-4f8b-a77a-6a8c9c7c4ad9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270169763-ffe4f329-8bd0-41ea-8104-8cdc83ad7237.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>加了overide:表示你真正要复写父类的方法或者重写</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270246840-6b700d83-8fd5-43d3-835b-cc87479d47f3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270304797-8455be81-9554-43f9-bd58-bfc96348b3aa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>11.属性修饰符</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270325126-cbd4b953-6401-416f-b3a0-42dc4ed53f92.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270380617-0fcba53e-3fc9-47fd-a055-82b0875dabed.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270429484-270e3bb8-39b8-48dd-acab-7ef05431bf8f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270455459-3331bc19-c837-403d-8805-abcbb5965f57.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270645427-c58afc5e-508b-4ad6-bde7-972770ede965.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270753488-efd859b9-309d-4a66-9676-5a976f012ee8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270729588-146e1c40-8a9d-4530-a83f-7b7e85098156.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270808517-5b299237-b85d-4281-9496-51fa47e3706c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>12.抽象类</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270861995-3dabd6a3-0c2c-41b0-b8f1-6e0c57e4b193.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270877087-113baabf-f330-4a79-a117-7f93a204a9a0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这样已经算具体实现了<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788270977722-67baeaa7-7ce4-4382-a6a3-ebc5a5cf176e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788271263889-90b31f8e-54ff-4eb6-b992-6f5000b7a6ad.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788273793066-0e343f74-b9a8-4a13-88d9-532959241777.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>13.interface（接口）</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788273981049-825d784c-2c49-4d2d-9744-226888afabbe.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788273988090-570b62df-4dea-48f3-90d0-7094226b00ac.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788274370910-ff6fc78a-d444-4c8d-8f1f-dbba7c0a5d31.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788274444347-fe003d1e-5ac5-414e-a238-61e4f70f0bce.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788274489848-2c62f8a6-2404-46bd-a0cf-bf981ea34cb5.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788274574707-56c25c30-5afc-4f92-b05d-7699f032c3ea.png\" alt=\"\">这个就是接口的可重复定义<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788274604018-a7f79b33-5006-48db-ae80-98eae1f2572c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>11.一些相似概念的区别</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788274659108-937bd755-e620-4ca4-801c-da1688275338.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788274713713-9673bb25-017a-48e0-b085-edc2f163bf61.png\" alt=\"\">这两个是可以互换的</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788274758202-2653590b-0d3f-41e6-ab1f-f35ac0da4400.png\" alt=\"\">可以集成，合并</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788274954804-ee1ebce4-9db0-4270-b32f-64ee2cab5c04.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788274995206-2f5f45aa-b524-4d19-bbba-e24ee3fe239f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275034477-8b0c8dfe-ec72-4d05-8704-90e599e6d3d9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>8.泛型</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275127620-aa150711-b265-4be5-b6a4-ceb181297fa7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275243573-6ead3d0c-fda0-44d9-ab2d-77257be73e21.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275282901-08e6a738-0562-4968-ab30-7cd8d3f3593c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275275406-c6b5ea87-03ad-4a55-991e-16a8e171d1f5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275314967-69988aa2-7b4c-4961-995d-f747a02fec0c.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275374113-1f3de608-da5e-4029-938e-7bbc4380abf8.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275379815-1a668824-1c52-4e83-b183-ddf92f9c00cc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275846541-fbce3540-8e14-418a-ad13-c4755ffd87c6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275770228-7460f98c-610b-4238-bfa5-7e4cc8029005.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275807787-bef3f9ca-345c-4256-9901-f2fb75b58070.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275819090-887633ff-39ba-4d68-ae72-c3b2d0127314.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>重开，就可以了：</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275692433-ad18594b-2ea9-4d08-93d0-45fbba7e6464.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275860938-756a89f9-eaf0-4391-b3c9-58fdf45b75dc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788275887104-17fadffd-0b0d-41d6-9ea7-cd4c57029233.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>11.属性修饰符</h2>\n<h2>11.属性修饰符</h2>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":82975999,"category":{"id":82975999,"name":"Ts","description":""},"created_at":"2026-08-31T14:13:54.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T14:19:32.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/hvdltf/xuz3c1ugsnh6w8ue","slug":"xuz3c1ugsnh6w8ue","wordCount":183}